      "title": "Archiving blogs: Rogue Scholar and lessons from Biome",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>&lt;em&gt; GigaBlog is now archived in Rogue Scholar, a new service that provides what it calls \"science blogging on steroids\" through including full-text search, long-term archiving, DOIs and metadata for science blogs such as ours. &lt;/em&gt; While this July we celebrated the 11 &lt;sup&gt; th &lt;/sup&gt; anniversary of the launch of our first articles at ISMB in Lyon, it was actually the 12 &lt;sup&gt; th &lt;/sup&gt; anniversary of the launch of GigaBlog, the blog of GigaScience</jats:p>",
